---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumb from '../components/astro/Breadcrumb.astro';
---
<SiteLayout title="Website Terms | Gibraltar For Sale" description="Terms for using the Gibraltar For Sale information website.">
  <Breadcrumb items={[{ label: 'Terms' }]} />
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-[1000px] px-5 pb-20 pt-10 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 lg:pb-28 lg:pt-16">
    <p class="text-xs font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[.18em] text-sea-700">Terms of use</p>
    <h1 class="mt-3 font-display text-5xl font-semibold leading-tight text-ink-900 sm:text-6xl">Using this website</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-stone-600">Last reviewed 10 November 2026</p>
    <div class="article-content mt-8">
      <p>Gibraltar For Sale currently publishes general property guidance, area information and market-data methodology. By using the site, you agree to use its information responsibly and check important details against current sources.</p>
      <h2 id="not-professional-advice">No professional advice</h2>
      <p>Content is for general information only. It is not legal, tax, immigration, mortgage, investment or financial advice. Rules, prices, availability and personal circumstances change. Consult appropriately qualified Gibraltar professionals before making property decisions.</p>
      <h2 id="sources">Sources and accuracy</h2>
      <p>Articles include source links where appropriate. A citation does not guarantee that information is current or applicable to your situation. No verified property listings, agent relationships, developer claims or private-market statistics are currently offered.</p>
      <h2 id="availability">No transaction or enquiry service</h2>
      <p>The website does not currently operate a property marketplace, accept property enquiries, arrange viewings or send property alerts. No sale, rental, agency or financial-service offer is made through the current information pages.</p>
      <h2 id="external-links">External links</h2>
      <p>Links to external sources are for reference only. Their content and availability are controlled by their respective operators.</p>
      <h2 id="intellectual-property">Intellectual property</h2>
      <p>Original website content and visual assets are subject to the rights identified on their respective pages. Third-party photographs remain subject to the author and license linked in the image credit; observe any attribution and share-alike terms before reuse.</p>
      <h2 id="changes">Changes to terms</h2>
      <p>These terms may change as the website develops. They describe the present information-only release and do not replace a contract for any future service.</p>
      <h2 id="contact">Questions</h2>
      <p>Verified operator contact details are not yet published. The <a href="/contact/" class="font-bold text-sea-700 underline">Contact page</a> explains the current status.</p>
    </div>
  </article>
</SiteLayout>
